{"sha": "8ec11d897fe6f769f3019b6844c3f2616e69cfc1cf8267981d6679e004022e08", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:solid-state} 章 --- 固体化学：能带、缺陷与半导体}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:1}", "$(E - \\alpha)/|\\beta| = -2\\cos(k\\pi/7)$：$-1.802$、$-1.247$、$-0.445$、$+0.445$、$+1.247$、$+1.802$。它们跨越", "$3.604|\\beta|$，已达无限长链带宽 $4|\\beta|$ 的 90\\,\\%。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:2}", "$2N$（$N$ 个轨道，每个轨道两个电子）。钠每原子有一个 3s 电子，", "故其 s 能带半充满，为金属。镁每原子有两个电子，恰可充满其 s 能带，", "但 3s 与 3p 能带相互重叠，故最高占据能级属于", "一个部分充满的合并能带，同样为金属。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:3}", "$\\lambda \\approx \\qty{1239.8}{eV.nm}/E_g$：磷化镓 \\qty{549}{nm}（绿色）；氮化镓 \\qty{365}{nm}", "（近紫外）。蓝色二极管使用与铟形成合金的氮化镓，其", "带隙较小。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:4}", "$\\ce{CaCl2} \\xrightarrow{\\ce{NaCl}} \\mathrm{Ca_{Na}^{\\bullet} + V_{Na}' + 2\\,Cl_{Cl}^{\\times}}$：两个阳离子位和两个阴离子位，与 NaCl 相同；一个 Ca 和", "两个 Cl；电荷 $+1 - 1 = 0$。$\\ce{Y2O3} \\xrightarrow{\\ce{ZrO2}} \\mathrm{2\\,Y_{Zr}' + 3\\,O_O^{\\times} + V_O^{\\bullet\\bullet}}$：两个阳离子位和四个氧位；两个 Y", "和三个 O；电荷 $-2 + 2 = 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:5}", "在 \\qty{300}{K} 时 $T^{3/2} = 5196$，$kT = \\qty{0.02585}{eV}$。硅：$\\sqrt{N_cN_v} = \\qty{2.42e19}{cm^{-3}}$，$\\eu^{-1.125/0.05170} = \\num{3.55e-10}$，", "$n_i = \\qty{8.6e9}{cm^{-3}}$。锗：$\\sqrt{N_cN_v} = \\qty{7.16e18}{cm^{-3}}$，$\\eu^{-0.661/0.05170} = \\num{2.80e-6}$，$n_i = \\qty{2.0e13}{cm^{-3}}$。比值", "$\\num{4.3e-4}$：锗的带隙较小，使其", "载流子数多出两千倍以上。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:6}", "$n = N_D = \\qty{1.0e16}{cm^{-3}}$; $p = n_i^2/n = \\num{1.0e20}/\\num{1.0e16} = \\qty{1.0e4}{cm^{-3}}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:7}", "$E_F - E_i = kT\\ln(n/n_i) = \\qty{0.02585}{eV} \\times \\ln(10^6) = \\qty{0.36}{eV}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:8}", "在 \\qty{800}{K} 时 $kT = \\qty{0.06894}{eV}$；$n/N = \\eu^{-2.3/0.1379} = \\num{5.7e-8}$；每摩尔中 $\\num{6.02e23} \\times \\num{5.7e-8} = \\num{3.4e16}$", "个缺陷对。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:9}", "晶胞质量为 $\\rho a^3 = \\qty{5.70}{g.cm^{-3}} \\times (\\qty{4.300e-8}{cm})^3 = \\qty{4.532e-22}{g}$，即", "$\\qty{4.532e-22}{g} \\times N_A = \\qty{272.9}{g}$（每摩尔晶胞），或按每个氧计为 \\qty{68.23}{g}。于是", "$(1 - x) \\times 55.8 + 16.0 = 68.23$，得 $1 - x = 0.936$：$x = 0.064$，$\\mathrm{Fe_{0.936}O}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:10}", "$\\ln(\\sigma T)$：$-3.51$、$-1.30$、$0.36$，对应 $1/T = 3.333$、$2.857$、$\\qty{2.500e-3}{K^{-1}}$；端点间的斜率", "$(0.36 + 3.51)/(-\\qty{8.33e-4}{K^{-1}}) = -\\qty{4.65e3}{K}$（中间点恰在直线上），故", "$E_a = \\qty{4.65e3}{K} \\times \\qty{8.617e-5}{eV.K^{-1}} = \\qty{0.40}{eV}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:11}", "$\\tfrac12\\ce{O2} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{O_O^{\\times} + V_M' + h^{\\bullet}}$，$K = [\\mathrm{V_M'}][\\mathrm h^\\bullet]/p(\\ce{O2})^{1/2}$。电荷平衡 $[\\mathrm h^\\bullet] = [\\mathrm{V_M'}]$，故", "$[\\mathrm h^\\bullet]^2 = K\\,p(\\ce{O2})^{1/2}$，且 $[\\mathrm h^\\bullet] \\propto p(\\ce{O2})^{1/4}$；电导率随空穴变化。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:solid-state:12}", "$n/N = \\sqrt{N_i/N}\\,\\eu^{-\\Delta H_F/2kT} = \\sqrt 2\\,\\eu^{-1.4/(2 \\times 0.05170)} = 1.414 \\times \\num{1.32e-6} = \\num{1.9e-6}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b3:solid-state:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\ce{Y2O3} \\xrightarrow{\\ce{ZrO2}} \\mathrm{2\\,Y_{Zr}' + 3\\,O_O^{\\times} + V_O^{\\bullet\\bullet}}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} 位点：两个阳离子位和四个氧位（三个占据，一个空），", "与 $\\ce{ZrO2}$ 的 1\\,:\\,2 比例一致。质量：每侧各有 2 个 Y 和 3 个 O。电荷：$2 \\times (-1) + 2 = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 两个钇离子对应一个空位：每个钇离子对应半个空位。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 每 $(\\ce{ZrO2})_{0.92}(\\ce{Y2O3})_{0.08}$ 含 0.92 个 Zr 和 0.16 个 Y，共 1.08 个阳离子：$x = 0.16/1.08 = 0.148$，", "$\\mathrm{Zr_{0.852}Y_{0.148}O_{1.926}}$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} $(x/2)/2 = 0.0370$：3.7\\,\\% 的氧位为空。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 每晶胞的空位数为 $8 \\times 0.0370 = 0.296$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $a^3 = (\\qty{5.14e-8}{cm})^3 = \\qty{1.358e-22}{cm^3}$: $0.296/\\qty{1.358e-22}{cm^3} = \\qty{2.2e21}{cm^{-3}}$.", "", "\\textbf{8.} 每个氧离子须越过 \\qty{1.0}{eV} 的势垒，跳入相邻的", "空位；成功尝试的比例 $\\eu^{-E_a/kT}$ 随 $T$ 迅速增大。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 在 \\qty{1073.15}{K} 时，$kT = \\qty{0.09248}{eV}$：$A = \\sigma T\\eu^{E_a/kT} = 0.030 \\times 1073.15 \\times \\eu^{10.81} = \\qty{1.6e6}{S.K.cm^{-1}}$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 在 \\qty{973.15}{K} 时：$\\sigma = (A/T)\\eu^{-11.92} = \\qty{0.011}{S.cm^{-1}}$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 在 \\qty{573.15}{K} 时：$\\sigma = (A/T)\\eu^{-20.25} = \\qty{4.5e-6}{S.cm^{-1}}$。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $R = L/(\\sigma S) = \\qty{0.10}{cm}/(\\sigma \\times \\qty{0.20}{cm^2})$：在 \\qty{700}{\\celsius} 时为 \\qty{46}{\\ohm}，在 \\qty{300}{\\celsius} 时为 $\\qty{1.1e5}{\\ohm}$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 要使 $R < \\qty{1}{k\\ohm}$，需 $\\sigma > \\qty{5.0e-4}{S.cm^{-1}}$；解 $(A/T)\\eu^{-E_a/kT} = \\num{5.0e-4}$（试差）", "得 $T \\approx \\qty{760}{K}$，约为 \\qty{490}{\\celsius}。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 启动后及低负荷时排气温度较低；加热器使", "电解质在数秒内达到工作温度，使控制", "系统从启动时即开始工作，而此时正是大部分污染物排放的时段。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $\\ce{O2 + 4e- -> 2O^2-}$；用克罗格–明克符号写为 $\\ce{O2} + \\mathrm{2\\,V_O^{\\bullet\\bullet} + 4\\,e'} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{2\\,O_O^{\\times}}$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 氧在空气侧被还原，氧离子在排气侧被重新氧化", "为氧气：电池把 $\\ce{O2}$ 由空气侧输送至排气侧，其中", "$\\Delta_rG = RT\\ln(p_{\\mathrm{exh}}/p_{\\mathrm{air}})$，每摩尔 $\\ce{O2}$ 对应四个电子：$E = -\\Delta_rG/4F = (RT/4F)\\ln(p_{\\mathrm{air}}/p_{\\mathrm{exh}})$。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $RT/4F = 8.3145 \\times 973.15/(4 \\times 96485) = \\qty{0.02096}{V}$.", "", "\\textbf{18.} 为零：两侧压强相等。", "", "\\textbf{19.} $(RT/4F)\\ln 10 = \\qty{48.3}{mV}$ 每十倍。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $\\qty{0.02096}{V} \\times \\ln(0.2095/0.010) = \\qty{0.02096}{V} \\times 3.04 = \\qty{0.064}{V}$.", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\qty{0.02096}{V} \\times \\ln(0.2095/\\num{1.0e-20}) = \\qty{0.02096}{V} \\times 44.49 = \\qty{0.93}{V}$.", "", "\\textbf{22.} 富燃排气中含有一氧化碳、氢气和未燃", "烃类；在铂电极上，剩余的少量氧与其反应，", "$p(\\ce{O2})$ 由平衡 $\\ce{2CO + O2 <=> 2CO2}$ 与 $\\ce{2H2 + O2 <=> 2H2O}$ 决定，", "两者使其在 \\qty{700}{\\celsius} 时的数值极小。", "", "\\textbf{23.} $p = 0.2095\\,\\eu^{-0.45/0.02096} = \\qty{1.0e-10}{bar}$.", "", "\\textbf{24.} 在化学计量比附近，排气由轻微过量的", "氧转为轻微过量的 CO 和氢气：$p(\\ce{O2})$ 下降约十八", "个数量级，而燃料仅有少量变化，电压由", "低于 \\qty{0.1}{V} 跃升至约 \\qty{0.9}{V}。发动机控制系统在电压低时加入燃料，", "电压高时则减少燃料，使混合气保持在化学计量点，", "此时三效催化剂可同时转化 CO、烃类和氮氧化物。", "", "\\textbf{25.} 在 \\qty{700}{\\celsius} 的富燃排气中，传感器输出约 \\qty{0.93}{V}。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}